OL,3,A'It's not Alton Towers' - rows break
OL,4,Aout over queuing at Wales' highest
OL,5,Amountain
OL,6,
OL,7,FVisitors to Wales' highest mountain are
OL,8,Fbeing urged to respect others by not
OL,9,Fskipping queues to reach the top
OL,10,Ffollowing rows among climbers.
OL,12,FRecent hot weather means there have
OL,13,Fbeen bumper summer crowds at Yr Wyddfa,
OL,14,Falso known as Snowdon, where people
OL,15,Fhave reportedly waited more than one
OL,16,Fhour to reach the 1,085m (3,560ft)-high
OL,17,Fsummit.
OL,19,FSocial media videos have shown
OL,20,Farguments among queue-jumpers and those
OL,21,Fpatiently waiting their turn to touch
OL,22,Fthe metal plate that marks the top.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
