OL,3,A'It's not Alton Towers' - rows break
OL,4,Aout over queuing at Wales' highest
OL,5,Amountain
OL,6,
OL,7,FA recent video showed Marc Screeton,
OL,8,Ffrom Manchester, being heckled as he
OL,9,Fbypassed the line, saying: "Imagine
OL,10,Fqueuing on a mountain? No chance."
